# Allowlist: only original work is tracked.
# Disc images, test builds, BIOS files and extracted game art are copyrighted
# and must never be committed, so everything else is ignored.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!mm8tool.py
!helper_map.txt
!globals_map.txt
# Screenshots of the patched game (PNG only) for the README and release page.
!screenshots/
!screenshots/*.png
# patches/ stays out: xdeltas carry game data. The release is a builder that
# reads everything game-related from the user's own discs.
